# Modern E-Commerce Analytics Lakehouse Pipeline

An end-to-end Data Engineering pipeline simulating a production-grade modern data lakehouse architecture for e-commerce analytical tracking. 

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Architecture
- **Orchestration:** Apache Airflow
- **Processing Engine:** Apache Spark (PySpark)
- **Data Warehouse & Storage:** PostgreSQL & Parquet File Format
- **Transformation & Modeling:** dbt (Data Build Tool)
- **Infrastructure:** Docker & Docker Compose

## 🚀 Key Engineering Highlights
1. **Medallion Architecture:** Raw JSON logs (Bronze) -> Partitioned Cleaned Parquet (Silver) -> Dimension/Fact Tables in PostgreSQL Marts (Gold).
2. **Defensive Pipeline Design:** Implemented tasks with automated retries, rigorous logging, and explicit error simulation handling.
3. **Data Quality First:** Every daily run triggers `dbt test` assertions ensuring zero data anomalies make it to the business dashboards.

